<title>UK: Morgan Stanley sets 1.0 bln Ffr bond.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley sets 1.0 bln Ffr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MORGAN STANLEY GROUP INC</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN FFR   COUPON     5.125     MATURITY    11.APR.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.285   PAY DATE    11.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.76     SPREAD	+35 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  LISTING    PAR/LON   PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED 2002 AND 2003 OATS</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF GLOBAL MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
